-    | L_2 | 13 | | L_3 | 45 |
-    | L_4 | 4,12 | | B_SD | 20,44 |
-    | R_1 | 1 | | R_2 | 11,27 |
-
-    Alive: T_SD, L_1, L_2, L_3, L_4, B_SD. Dead: R_1, R_2. Liveness on the provided configuration is
-    re-confirmed at Gate C.
-- **Provided contact configuration** (hardwired):
-
-  | role | label |
-  |---|---|
-  | source | T_SD |
-  | drain (`sr0`) | B_SD |
-  | `sr1` (Rxx) | B_SD–L4 |
-  | `sr2` (Rxx) | L4–L1 |
-  | `sr3` (Rxx) | L3–L2 |
